le (i.e., does not upgrade).\n\nI did more tests in 4.7.1-stable_linux, observed same behavior as in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120405#issuecomment-4880649816\n\nAttached is a MRP (very basic project) created in 4.6.3-stable_linux:\n\n[zipped_issue-120405_MRP_created-in-4.6.3.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30036621/zipped_issue-120405_MRP_created-in-4.6.3.zip)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4977849419/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4980120740","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120405#issuecomment-4980120740","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120405","id":4980120740,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKNacpA","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-15T11:40:58Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T12:09:05Z","body":"Can reproduce in 4.8 dev 2622837\n\nThe problem seems to be this line\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/26228372b9a3d766058f886d390293c3592bac6d/editor/editor_node.cpp#L1056\nIt returns `false` for some reason, as if called too early. Works correctly in 4.6.3, so maybe something has changed.\n\nTested on Linux/Wayland.\n\nEDIT:\nThis condition works correctly, and it's ran earlier\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/26228372b9a3d766058f886d390293c3592bac6d/editor/editor_node.cpp#L8399\nIt's definitely bugged. I can fix the editor bug, but the `window_can_draw()` needs to be looked at.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4980120740/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4983172446","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120405#issuecomment-4983172446","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120405","id":4983172446,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKQUtXg","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"http